{"id":182,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"広い視野と創造力を仲間と磨く学習院教育","feature_description":"学習院中等科は「ひろい視野・たくましい創造力・ゆたかな感受性」を教育の柱とし、人と集い出会う経験から学ぶことを重視します。授業だけでなく、部活動や委員会、友人・先輩・後輩・教員との交流を通じ、異なる考えや知識に触れて視野を広げます。得た経験を自分なりに考え、仲間と意見を交わしながら創造力を磨く教育を目指しています。自分と向き合う機会を重ね、個性を磨き、将来につながる知識や技能を身につけることを目指します。","clubs":[{"id":3367,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3368,"name":"硬式庭球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3369,"name":"古武道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3370,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3371,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3372,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3373,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3374,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3375,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3376,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3377,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":3378,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.gakushuin.ac.jp/bjh/slife/club/index.html","ver